  triage:title "report_runtime.py's cross-cutting placement under scripts/smoke/ is inconsistent with the repo's other cross-domain utility location" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB3-QA3-1789250000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1445#issuecomment-5648698551, 2026-09-12T21:08:20Z; BB3-QA3-M4), reviewed at 66be1d012. scripts/smoke/report_runtime.py is consumed cross-domain by both scripts/smoke/* and scripts/fuzz/render_report.py, but lives under scripts/smoke/ rather than top-level scripts/, where the repo's other genuinely cross-cutting utility (scripts/public_redaction.py) already lives. Non-blocking placement inconsistency." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
